{"id":"內衛藥製字第000220號","license":"內衛藥製字第000220號","name":"\"生達\" 力佳爽錠０．５公絲","english":"DEXAMETHASONE TABLETS 0.5MG \"STANDARD\"","version":"2","date":"2026-03-02","ingredient":"每錠含：\nDexamethasone…………………………. 0.5mg\nDexamethasone……………………….... 4mg","strength":"0.5MG","category":"肌肉骨骼系統","source_sha256":"407353244c66209f1f53b9e865ba27829b6efac5eb70317ca7e24a8dcc00d769","sections":[{"id":"s1","parent":null,"no":"1","title":"性狀","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s2","parent":"s1","no":"1.1","title":"有效成分及含量","level":"2","html":"<p>每錠含：<br>Dexamethasone…………………………. 0.5mg<br>Dexamethasone……………………….... 4mg</p>","text":"每錠含：\nDexamethasone…………………………. 0.5mg\nDexamethasone……………………….... 4mg","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s3","parent":"s1","no":"1.2","title":"賦形劑","level":"2","html":"<p>Potato Starch、Lactose Monohydrate、Povidone K-30、Vegetable Magnesium Stearate、Water Purified</p>","text":"Potato Starch、Lactose Monohydrate、Povidone K-30、Vegetable Magnesium Stearate、Water Purified","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s4","parent":"s1","no":"1.3","title":"劑型","level":"2","html":"<p>錠劑</p>","text":"錠劑","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s5","parent":"s1","no":"1.4","title":"藥品外觀","level":"2","html":"<p>0.5mg：白色五角形平面錠，一面中央有剝半線。<br>4mg：白色平面圓形錠。</p>","text":"0.5mg：白色五角形平面錠，一面中央有剝半線。\n4mg：白色平面圓形錠。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s6","parent":null,"no":"2","title":"適應症","level":"1","html":"<p>風濕性關節炎、風濕病熱、支氣管氣喘、濕疹、皮膚炎。</p>","text":"風濕性關節炎、風濕病熱、支氣管氣喘、濕疹、皮膚炎。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s7","parent":null,"no":"3","title":"用法及用量","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s8","parent":"s7","no":"3.1","title":"用法用量","level":"2","html":"<p>0.5mg-成人一日3~6錠，分3~4次服用，中止投藥時要徐徐減量。兒童依年齡遞減。<br>4mg-通常成人一天量1-2錠。</p>","text":"0.5mg-成人一日3~6錠，分3~4次服用，中止投藥時要徐徐減量。兒童依年齡遞減。\n4mg-通常成人一天量1-2錠。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s9","parent":"s7","no":"3.2","title":"調製方式","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s10","parent":"s7","no":"3.3","title":"特殊族群用法用量","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s11","parent":null,"no":"4","title":"禁忌","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s12","parent":null,"no":"5","title":"警語及注意事項","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s13","parent":"s12","no":"5.1","title":"警語/注意事項","level":"2","html":"<p>急慢性感染症使用時請同時併用適當的化學療法劑或抗生素藥品，以治療感染疾病。<br>對消化管障礙如胃腸潰瘍，務請特別注意。<br>因主要副作用引起浮腫、血壓上升、所以腎臟疾患及高血壓患者應注意。<br>糖尿病患者使用時，請注意有增加Insulin用量的必要。<br>對於有精神病因素者多加注意。<br>服用本劑期間請補充蛋白質。</p>","text":"急慢性感染症使用時請同時併用適當的化學療法劑或抗生素藥品，以治療感染疾病。\n對消化管障礙如胃腸潰瘍，務請特別注意。\n因主要副作用引起浮腫、血壓上升、所以腎臟疾患及高血壓患者應注意。\n糖尿病患者使用時，請注意有增加Insulin用量的必要。\n對於有精神病因素者多加注意。\n服用本劑期間請補充蛋白質。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s14","parent":"s12","no":"5.2","title":"藥物濫用及依賴性","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s15","parent":"s12","no":"5.3","title":"操作機械能力","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s16","parent":"s12","no":"5.4","title":"實驗室檢測","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s17","parent":"s12","no":"5.5","title":"其他注意事項","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s18","parent":null,"no":"6","title":"特殊族群注意事項","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s19","parent":"s18","no":"6.1","title":"懷孕","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s20","parent":"s18","no":"6.2","title":"哺乳","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s21","parent":"s18","no":"6.3","title":"有生育能力的女性與男性","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s22","parent":"s18","no":"6.4","title":"小兒","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s23","parent":"s18","no":"6.5","title":"老年人","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s24","parent":"s18","no":"6.6","title":"肝功能不全","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s25","parent":"s18","no":"6.7","title":"腎功能不全","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s26","parent":"s18","no":"6.8","title":"其他族群","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s27","parent":null,"no":"7","title":"交互作用","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s28","parent":null,"no":"8","title":"副作用/不良反應","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s29","parent":"s28","no":"8.1","title":"臨床重要副作用/不良反應","level":"2","html":"<p>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s30","parent":"s28","no":"8.2","title":"臨床試驗經驗","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s31","parent":"s28","no":"8.3","title":"上市後經驗","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s32","parent":null,"no":"9","title":"過量","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s33","parent":null,"no":"10","title":"藥理特性","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s34","parent":"s33","no":"10.1","title":"作用機轉","level":"2","html":"<p>本劑主成分Dexamethasone為一種合成之副腎皮質荷爾蒙劑，其化學名為9-α-Fluoro-16-α-Methyl Prednisolone，具有其他副腎皮質荷爾蒙應有的基本作用與效果。其抗炎、抗風濕及過敏性的效力較其他副腎皮質荷爾蒙強，且副作用較低。</p>","text":"本劑主成分Dexamethasone為一種合成之副腎皮質荷爾蒙劑，其化學名為9-α-Fluoro-16-α-Methyl Prednisolone，具有其他副腎皮質荷爾蒙應有的基本作用與效果。其抗炎、抗風濕及過敏性的效力較其他副腎皮質荷爾蒙強，且副作用較低。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s35","parent":"s33","no":"10.2","title":"藥效藥理特性","level":"2","html":"<p>本劑不會引起血壓上昇，鈉滯留或鉀之過量性排泄。</p><p>本劑副作用少，如應用其他副皮質荷爾蒙所引起之食慾不振、體重減輕、暈眩、筋肌無力等副作用，少見於應用本劑之病例。<br>本劑之效力依臨床治療觀察比較，較6-Methyl Prednisolone或 Triamcinolone強6倍，較Prednisone或Prednisolone強6倍至8倍，較Hydrocortisone強25~30倍，較 Cortisone強35倍。</p>","text":"本劑不會引起血壓上昇，鈉滯留或鉀之過量性排泄。\n本劑副作用少，如應用其他副皮質荷爾蒙所引起之食慾不振、體重減輕、暈眩、筋肌無力等副作用，少見於應用本劑之病例。\n本劑之效力依臨床治療觀察比較，較6-Methyl Prednisolone或 Triamcinolone強6倍，較Prednisone或Prednisolone強6倍至8倍，較Hydrocortisone強25~30倍，較 Cortisone強35倍。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s36","parent":"s33","no":"10.3","title":"臨床前安全性資料","level":"2","html":"<p>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s37","parent":null,"no":"11","title":"藥物動力學特性","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s38","parent":null,"no":"12","title":"臨床試驗資料","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s39","parent":null,"no":"13","title":"包裝及儲存","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s40","parent":"s39","no":"13.1","title":"包裝","level":"2","html":"<p>0.5mg-1000錠以下瓶裝。<br>4mg-1000錠以下瓶盒裝。</p>","text":"0.5mg-1000錠以下瓶裝。\n4mg-1000錠以下瓶盒裝。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s41","parent":"s39","no":"13.2","title":"效期","level":"2","html":"<p>如外包裝所示</p>","text":"如外包裝所示","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s42","parent":"s39","no":"13.3","title":"儲存條件","level":"2","html":"<p>貯存條件：25℃以下儲存</p>","text":"貯存條件：25℃以下儲存","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s43","parent":"s39","no":"13.4","title":"儲存注意事項","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s44","parent":null,"no":"14","title":"病人使用須知","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s45","parent":null,"no":"15","title":"其他","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_sou